steps:
Replace Program.cs with (args[0] is whatever you pass after dotnet run --):
string texto = args.Length > 0 ? args[0] : "3";
decimal preco = 4.50m;
int qtd = 0;
try
{
    qtd = int.Parse(texto);
}
catch (Exception)
{
}
Console.WriteLine($"Total: R$ {qtd * preco:F2}");

Run dotnet run -- abc. Then replace the whole try/catch block (from int qtd = 0; to the catch’s closing brace) with the TryParse block:
if (!int.TryParse(texto, out int qtd))
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Quantidade inválida: \"{texto}\"");
    return;
}
and run dotnet run -- abc again.
